---
// Guarantees, Certifications, Insurance & Response Time banner displayed on every page
---

<section class="trust-guarantees-section" style="background: linear-gradient(180deg, #FFFFFF 0%, var(--color-surface) 100%); border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border); padding: 3.5rem 0;">
  <div class="container">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div style="text-align: center; max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto 3rem;">
      <span class="badge badge-primary" style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 15px;">verified</span>
        Engagements & Transparence Artisane
      </span>
      <h2 style="font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.5rem); margin-bottom: 1rem; color: var(--color-navy);">
        Nos Garanties Officielles, Agréments et Assurances
      </h2>
      <p style="color: var(--color-navy-muted); font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">
        Faire appel a Plombier Mons Urgent, c'est choisir un artisan local certifie par la Region Wallonne, assure a 100% et engage par ecrit sur ses delais et ses tarifs.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 5 Pillars Grid -->
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
      
      <!-- 1. Années d'expérience -->
      <div class="card" style="background: white; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-top: 4px solid var(--color-teal); display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
          <div style="width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 10px; background: rgba(0, 128, 128, 0.1); color: var(--color-teal); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0;">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 26px;">history_edu</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span style="font-size: 0.75rem; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 800; color: var(--color-teal); letter-spacing: 0.05em;">Historique Artisanal</span>
            <h3 style="font-size: 1.15rem; margin: 0; color: var(--color-navy);">Plus de 15 Ans d'Expérience</h3>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p style="font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--color-navy-muted); line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 1rem; flex-grow: 1;">
          Établis a Mons depuis 2009, nous avons réalise plus de 8 500 interventions d'urgence et rénovations sanitaires dans tout le bassin montois et le Borinage. Une véritable entreprise familiale aux racines locales solides.
        </p>
        <div style="font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-navy); padding-top: 0.75rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 16px; color: var(--color-teal);">check_circle</span>
          Fondé en 2009 a Mons (7000)
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 2. Assurances -->
      <div class="card" style="background: white; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-top: 4px solid var(--color-teal); display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
          <div style="width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 10px; background: rgba(0, 128, 128, 0.1); color: var(--color-teal); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0;">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 26px;">shield</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span style="font-size: 0.75rem; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 800; color: var(--color-teal); letter-spacing: 0.05em;">Protection Totale</span>
            <h3 style="font-size: 1.15rem; margin: 0; color: var(--color-navy);">Assurance AXA Belgium</h3>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p style="font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--color-navy-muted); line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 1rem; flex-grow: 1;">
          Responsabilite Civile Professionnelle et garantie decennale souscrites aupres d'AXA Belgium (Police N° 730.294.108). Rapports techniques d'expertise circonstancies reconnus par toutes les assurances belges (AG, AXA, Belfius, Ethias, Baloise).
        </p>
        <div style="font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-navy); padding-top: 0.75rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 16px; color: var(--color-teal);">check_circle</span>
          Couverture sinistre & dégât des eaux
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 3. Toutes les certifications -->
      <div class="card" style="background: white; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-top: 4px solid var(--color-teal); display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
          <div style="width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 10px; background: rgba(0, 128, 128, 0.1); color: var(--color-teal); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0;">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 26px;">workspace_premium</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span style="font-size: 0.75rem; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 800; color: var(--color-teal); letter-spacing: 0.05em;">Habilitations d'État</span>
            <h3 style="font-size: 1.15rem; margin: 0; color: var(--color-navy);">Agréments Officiels Complets</h3>
          </div>
        </div>
        <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 1rem 0; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--color-navy-muted); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.4rem; flex-grow: 1;">
          <li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem;">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 15px; color: var(--color-teal);">verified</span>
            <strong>Agréé CERGA Gaz :</strong> Habilitation N° 09-34821
          </li>
          <li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem;">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 15px; color: var(--color-teal);">verified</span>
            <strong>Attestation PEB Wallonie :</strong> Technicien agréé
          </li>
          <li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem;">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 15px; color: var(--color-teal);">verified</span>
            <strong>Certifié Belgaqua :</strong> Réseaux d'eau potable
          </li>
          <li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem;">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 15px; color: var(--color-teal);">verified</span>
            <strong>Norme VCA :</strong> Sécurité des chantiers
          </li>
        </ul>
        <div style="font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-navy); padding-top: 0.75rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 16px; color: var(--color-teal);">check_circle</span>
          Enregistrement BCE : BE 0657.003.874
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 4. Délais d'intervention -->
      <div class="card" style="background: white; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-top: 4px solid var(--color-alert); display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
          <div style="width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 10px; background: rgba(224, 90, 71, 0.1); color: var(--color-alert); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0;">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 26px;">timer</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span style="font-size: 0.75rem; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 800; color: var(--color-alert); letter-spacing: 0.05em;">Engagement Réactivité</span>
            <h3 style="font-size: 1.15rem; margin: 0; color: var(--color-navy);">Sur Place en 20 à 30 Min</h3>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p style="font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--color-navy-muted); line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 1rem; flex-grow: 1;">
          Permanence d'astreinte 24h/24 et 7j/7 sans interruption. Arrivée en 10 a 15 minutes sur Mons-Centre, Nimy, Cuesmes, Ghlin et Jemappes, et sous 25 a 30 minutes sur l'ensemble du Borinage. Prise d'appel en moins de 10 secondes.
        </p>
        <div style="font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-alert); padding-top: 0.75rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 16px; color: var(--color-alert);">emergency</span>
          Astreinte continue 365j / an
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 5. Garanties de service -->
      <div class="card" style="background: white; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-top: 4px solid var(--color-teal); display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
          <div style="width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 10px; background: rgba(0, 128, 128, 0.1); color: var(--color-teal); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0;">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 26px;">handshake</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span style="font-size: 0.75rem; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 800; color: var(--color-teal); letter-spacing: 0.05em;">Sécurité Client</span>
            <h3 style="font-size: 1.15rem; margin: 0; color: var(--color-navy);">Garanties de Service Claires</h3>
          </div>
        </div>
        <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 1rem 0; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--color-navy-muted); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.4rem; flex-grow: 1;">
          <li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem;">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 15px; color: var(--color-teal);">check</span>
            <strong>Devis 100% ferme :</strong> Rédigé avant tout geste
          </li>
          <li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem;">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 15px; color: var(--color-teal);">check</span>
            <strong>Garantie décennale :</strong> 10 ans sur installations
          </li>
          <li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem;">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 15px; color: var(--color-teal);">check</span>
            <strong>Pièces d'origine :</strong> Garantie constructeur 2 ans
          </li>
          <li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem;">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 15px; color: var(--color-teal);">check</span>
            <strong>TVA 6% applicable :</strong> Logements de + de 10 ans
          </li>
        </ul>
        <div style="font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-navy); padding-top: 0.75rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 16px; color: var(--color-teal);">verified</span>
          Garantie de résultat sur toute réparation
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Quick Emergency Action Strip inside banner -->
    <div style="background: var(--color-navy); color: white; border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.5rem 2rem; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1.5rem;">
      <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem;">
        <div style="width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--color-alert); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0;">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 24px; color: white;">phone_in_talk</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <strong style="font-size: 1.1rem; display: block; color: white;">Une urgence de plomberie ou de chauffage à Mons ?</strong>
          <span style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: #94A3B8;">Techniciens d'astreinte déployables en 20 à 30 minutes réelles dans tout le Hainaut.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <a href="tel:0489164378" class="btn btn-alert" style="padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem; font-size: 1rem;">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined">call</span>
          Ligne Directe 24/7 : 0489 16 43 78
        </a>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-outline" style="border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4); color: white; padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem; font-size: 0.95rem;">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined">request_quote</span>
          Demander un devis
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
